  "solution": "$$\\frac{dt}{dx} = 2x + 1 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; v = \\frac{dx}{dt} = \\frac{1}{2x + 1}$$\n\n$$a = \\frac{dv}{dt} = \\frac{dv}{dx}\\cdot\\frac{dx}{dt} = \\left(-\\frac{2}{(2x + 1)^2}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{2x + 1} = -\\frac{2}{(2x + 1)^3}$$",
